// Config.xcconfig — base build configuration for the AéroCheck app target.
//
// Real secrets are NOT stored here. They live in the untracked Secrets.xcconfig
// (gitignored), which this file optionally includes and which overrides the empty
// defaults below. See Secrets.example.xcconfig for the template, and the
// "OpenAIP API key" section in CLAUDE.md for full setup notes.

// --- Secret defaults (overridden by Secrets.xcconfig when present) ---
// An empty key degrades gracefully: OpenAIP tiles/CTR requests 401 and the
// airspace overlay simply doesn't render — the app does not crash.
OPENAIP_API_KEY =

// Pull in untracked local secrets if the file exists (the "?" makes it optional,
// so a fresh checkout without Secrets.xcconfig still builds). Later assignments
// win, so a value here overrides the empty default above.
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"

// --- API endpoint (SEC-C2 / SUB-2) ---
// The production worker refuses Sandbox StoreKit transactions, because a TestFlight purchase is
// free and unlimited and would otherwise unlock the whole premium catalogue. TestFlight builds
// therefore have to talk to the sandbox worker to exercise the paid flow at all.
//
// IMPORTANT: build configuration alone CANNOT identify a TestFlight build — TestFlight ships the
// *Release* configuration, exactly like the App Store (see the scheme's ArchiveAction). Keying the
// endpoint off `[config=Debug]` therefore sent every TestFlight build to production, where its
// Sandbox JWS was rejected with SANDBOX_IN_PRODUCTION and premium content silently stayed locked.
// The real discriminator is the StoreKit receipt environment, resolved at runtime in APIConfig.swift.
//
// So: API_BASE_URL is the endpoint for a normal App Store build, API_BASE_URL_SANDBOX is used
// whenever the running build has a Sandbox receipt (TestFlight, and Debug on device/simulator).
// Override either in Secrets.xcconfig (untracked) to aim a local build somewhere else, e.g.
// http://localhost:8787 for `npm run dev`.
API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/api.aerocheck.app
API_BASE_URL_SANDBOX = https:/$()/api-sandbox.aerocheck.app
